  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a646e7f9-e761-4979-a05a-c39407718c0c.png\"></p>\n<h3><em>你偶然发现了一个奇怪的频道，上面展示着一个咧嘴露出诡异笑容的笑脸表情；屏幕上的文字声称，在整个世界上再也找不到比这更好的朋友了。突然，一个链接出现了，引导你来到下载此模组的网站，一个神秘的包裹也随之出现在你的Minecraft世界中&mdash;里面究竟隐藏着什么？...</em></h3>\n</blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>与你的专属AI助手好友聊天吧！</strong></h1>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>功能特性：</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>AI驱动聊天：</strong>使用Gemini、GROQ甚至本地大语言模型（LLM），你可以与他探讨任何你感兴趣的话题！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>语音合成（TTS）支持：</strong>使用GROQ、ElevenLabs或本地TTS引擎，让你的新朋友用他自己的声音回答你！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>内置麦克风支持：</strong>无需安装任何额外模组即可与他对话（默认按键为V）！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>多人游戏支持：</strong>你的朋友可以加入你的精彩冒险，与你和伙伴同行！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>环境感知：</strong>他能告诉你许多关于你所处世界的信息！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>教程</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fgoebtv9iNvo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>英文教程</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eMpiJIvmhIg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>俄文教程</strong></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>安装指南</strong></h1>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>安装NeoForge</strong>：请按照<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdocs.neoforged.net%252fuser%252fdocs%252fclient\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>的说明进行操作。</li>\n<li><strong>安装 Personal Helper Friend 模组：</strong>下载并将 personalhelperfriend-*.jar 文件复制到 .minecraft/mods 文件夹中。</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong>使用Neoforge启动Minecraft</strong></li>\n<li><strong>配置模组：</strong>首次进入世界时，设置向导将自动引导你完成麦克风、API密钥和伙伴设置的配置。（设置完成后，按O键可找到部分设置选项）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>5. 你还需要安装 <a href=\"NEW UPDATE IS OUT https:/www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/personal-helper-friend/download/8432400 Changelog  *New mechanic related to the pistol from TaCZ (glock, default button for new interaction with glock is N) https:/discord.com/channels/1514695521267351592/1514696003679420588/1526242327864152257 this mechanic  *Improved moprh into companion, now you can change your emotions via numpad(could be changed in settings), your friend can pick you up on his head, and you can speak with him by pressing H  *If player who is hosting the game has a configured TTS you can enable(enabled by default) new setting in TTS section and text that companion saying will be send you from host  *Fixed some bugs related to multiplayer including  YOU SHOULD INSTALL THESE TWO MODS(optional, default key is N) you need to install it only if you want same feature as in video https:/discord.com/channels/1514695521267351592/1514696003679420588/1526242327864152257) https:/www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-1-21-1 https:/www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator @everyone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">TaCZ</a> 和 <a href=\"NEW UPDATE IS OUT https:/www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/personal-helper-friend/download/8432400 Changelog  *New mechanic related to the pistol from TaCZ (glock, default button for new interaction with glock is N) https:/discord.com/channels/1514695521267351592/1514696003679420588/1526242327864152257 this mechanic  *Improved moprh into companion, now you can change your emotions via numpad(could be changed in settings), your friend can pick you up on his head, and you can speak with him by pressing H  *If player who is hosting the game has a configured TTS you can enable(enabled by default) new setting in TTS section and text that companion saying will be send you from host  *Fixed some bugs related to multiplayer including  YOU SHOULD INSTALL THESE TWO MODS(optional, default key is N) you need to install it only if you want same feature as in video https:/discord.com/channels/1514695521267351592/1514696003679420588/1526242327864152257) https:/www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-1-21-1 https:/www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/playeranimator @everyone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">PlayerAnimator</a> 以启用模组的附加机制（可选）。</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>AI 设置选项</strong></h1>\n<p>本模组需要外部AI（大语言模型LLM）来生成回复，并需要语音合成（TTS）引擎将其转化为语音。</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &bull; 文本生成（AI/LLM）：</strong>你可以使用Google Gemini（提供免费的API密钥）或Groq。<br><strong>&nbsp; &bull; 语音生成（TTS）：</strong>你可以使用ElevenLabs（付费）或Groq（也提供免费API层级）等云端API，或者搭建本地TTS服务器，后者无需额外费用（注意：本地TTS服务器需由玩家手动配置）。&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>灵感来源：<strong>《微笑档案》（The Smiley Archive）</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
